pem file nahi hai iska matlab ye nahi ki file transfer impossible hai.

.pem sirf SSH authentication ka ek method hai.

Agar EC2-A se EC2-B par file bhejni hai:
scp /home/ubuntu/test.txt ubuntu@EC2-B-IP:/home/ubuntu/
Possible methods:

    SSH key authentication — .pem ke alawa koi private key bhi configured ho sakti hai.

    Password authentication — agar EC2-B par SSH password login enabled hai.

    AWS Systems Manager (SSM) — appropriate IAM/SSM setup ke saath.

    S3 — file ko S3 mein upload karke EC2-B se download kar sakte ho.
