Agar aapko poori Ubuntu EC2 machine ka backup chahiye

To backup.tar.gz copy karna aur EC2 machine ka complete backup alag cheezein hain.

Complete EC2 backup ke liye AWS mein EBS snapshots / AMI use karna generally appropriate hota hai. 
Agar goal hai ki AWS EC2 fail ho jaye to local Windows Server se data/backup restore kar saken, 
to backup strategy thodi different design karni chahiye.
