500 GB mein network interruption, resume, storage aur backup consistency important ho jati hai.
500 GB ke liye scp se better rsync over SSH ho sakta hai, kyunki interrupted transfer ko efficiently resume kiya ja sakta hai. 
Windows side par suitable rsync implementation chahiye.

